abstract: >-
  Construction management platform for the Pakistan market: BOQ and estimating
  in PKR, quantity takeoff from PDF and CAD drawings, scheduling, procurement,
  site management, interim payment certificates, and federal / provincial sales
  tax on services (FBR, PRA, SRB, KPRA, BRA). Urdu and English interface.
